OL,3,GNEWSANoah Woods left playground through
OL,4,Agap in fence, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree-year-old Noah Woods who was found
OL,7,Fdead in a pond following a huge search
OL,8,Fin Suffolk had left a play area
OL,9,F"through a gap in the fence", an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FA major search was carried out in the
OL,13,Fvillage of Brantham after the toddler
OL,14,Fwent missing on Tuesday, 15 September.
OL,15,FHis body was found the next day in
OL,16,Fnearby water by police divers.
OL,18,FAssistant coroner Jyoti Gill said it
OL,19,Fwas a "very sad and tragic death" as
OL,20,Fshe opened and adjourned the inquest in
OL,21,FIpswich.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
